## 2. Table Definitions

### `causes` Table
| Column | Type | Constraints | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | PK, DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() | Unique cause ID |
| title | VARCHAR(255) | NOT NULL | Cause title |
| description | TEXT | NOT NULL | Cause description |
| target_amount | DECIMAL(12,2) | DEFAULT 0 | Fundraising target |
| raised_amount | DECIMAL(12,2) | DEFAULT 0 | Amount raised so far |
| image_url | TEXT | NULLABLE | Cause banner image |
| is_active | BOOLEAN | DEFAULT true | Active/inactive flag |
| created_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | DEFAULT now() | Record creation time |
| updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | DEFAULT now() | Last update time |

### `donations` Table
| Column | Type | Constraints | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | PK, DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() | Unique donation ID |
| cause_id | UUID | FK → causes(id), NULLABLE | Associated cause |
| donor_name | VARCHAR(255) | NOT NULL | Donor full name |
| donor_email | VARCHAR(255) | NOT NULL | Donor email |
| donor_phone | VARCHAR(20) | NULLABLE | Donor phone number |
| amount | DECIMAL(12,2) | NOT NULL, CHECK > 0 | Donation amount |
| currency | VARCHAR(3) | DEFAULT 'INR' | Currency code |
| status | VARCHAR(20) | DEFAULT 'initiated' | Payment status |
| razorpay_order_id | VARCHAR(255) | UNIQUE, NULLABLE | Razorpay order reference |
| razorpay_payment_id | VARCHAR(255) | UNIQUE, NULLABLE | Razorpay payment reference |
| razorpay_signature | TEXT | NULLABLE | Payment verification signature |
| payment_method | VARCHAR(50) | NULLABLE | card/upi/netbanking/wallet |
| notes | TEXT | NULLABLE | Donor message or notes |
| created_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | DEFAULT now() | Donation initiation time |
| updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | DEFAULT now() | Last status update time |

### `admin_users` Table
| Column | Type | Constraints | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | PK, DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() | Unique admin ID |
| email | VARCHAR(255) | UNIQUE, NOT NULL | Admin email |
| name | VARCHAR(255) | NOT NULL | Admin display name |
| role | VARCHAR(20) | DEFAULT 'admin' | User role |
| supabase_auth_id | UUID | FK → auth.users(id) | Link to Supabase Auth |
| created_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | DEFAULT now() | Account creation time |
| updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | DEFAULT now() | Last update time |

