## 3. Donation Status Enum

| Status | Description | Triggered By |
|---|---|---|
| `initiated` | Order created, payment not started | Edge Function: `create-order` |
| `pending` | Payment completed, verification pending | Edge Function: `verify-payment` |
| `completed` | Payment confirmed via webhook | Edge Function: `razorpay-webhook` |
| `failed` | Payment failed or timed out | Edge Function: `razorpay-webhook` |
| `refunded` | Payment refunded (manual action) | Admin / Razorpay Dashboard |

