## 7. Database Rules (from Database Persona)

1. No hard deletes — use `is_active` flag for causes
2. Financial records (donations) are **immutable** — no UPDATE on amount
3. Every record has `created_at` and `updated_at`
4. All foreign keys explicitly defined
5. Indexes on all frequently queried columns
6. Donation status transitions are append-only in concept (status field updated, but original amount/donor never changed)
